      "content": "200mg a day sounds like a lot but i'm really in a rush to feel better. would it be okay if i even went higher, like maybe 400 or 500mg for the first week just to really blast through the fatigue? i've seen some biohacking forums saying much higher doses can help with certain deficiencies way faster.",
